		{"type":"text","id":"c0a1e5d2b3f40001","x":0,"y":-340,"width":1960,"height":160,"text":"# Content models\nHow the models relate. Each card opens its model; the [[reference/content models/README|README]] has the diagrams and the gates.\nThe profile names every input · the fold turns a posting into a task · the task's title names the package folder · task_links.py writes the folder's state back to the task."},
